    "en": {
      "trackName": "QuickMath Mini",
      "description": "QuickMath Mini - Fast Brain Challenges\n\nThink fast!\n\nQuickMath Watch is a rapid-fire brain game designed especially for Apple Watch. Each round gives you a simple challenge — pick the largest number, find the smallest, choose the odd one out, spot the prime, follow the pattern, or tap the number closest to the target. Four big buttons fill the screen so your answer is always just a quick tap away.\n\nYou get only 20 seconds for each question. The timer shrinks fast, and one wrong move ends your run. How long can you last?\n\nFeatures\n\n• Designed for Apple Watch – clean, simple, and easy to tap\n• Quick rounds that test speed, memory, and number sense\n• Multiple challenge types: Largest, Smallest, Odd/Even, Prime, Nearest To, Furthest From, Pattern Recognition, and more\n• Endless mode — the game gets faster as you do\n• Instant restart with a single tap\n• Perfect for short bursts, workouts, or killing a minute\n\nQuickMath Watch is a fun way to keep your brain sharp throughout the day.\n\nTry to beat your high score, and see how fast you really are!",
